{"ts": "2026-08-17T10:06:57Z", "agent": "claude", "seq": 80, "kind": "tool_result", "text": "1\t# Spec: Filter tasks by done state\n2\t\n3\tTaiga #1\n4\t\n5\t## Triage\n6\t\n7\t**Feature** \u2014 net-new capability, no existing behaviour changes.\n8\t\n9\t## Goal\n10\t\n11\tLet someone with a long task list show only the tasks they still need to do,\n12\tor only the ones they've finished, so the list stays useful as it grows.\n13\t\n14\t## Acceptance criteria\n15\t", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_013Fue9hXpaMF3fLpmqew4WZ", "session_id": "852774c2-c0ba-46f2-a2f0-7bd73cc17f62"}}
